  "[OBSERVATION IS KEY]": "[观察是关键]",
  "These are some strange words... I wonder what they mean? Perhaps Worder Boye could be of assistance.": "这些词语真奇怪……究竟是什么意思？也许语师博耶能帮上忙。",
  "Cutter and Crank said there's someone I should meet in the back room. But first, I need to gain access...": "卡特和克兰克说，后屋有人值得一见。但首先，我得想办法进去……",
  "Töj Böj gave me a ticket to [i]Cirkus Solöj[/i] at the [b]Feithish Courts[/b]. I should try to locate it and see what I may find.": "特伊·贝伊给了我一张[b]费蒂什庭院[/b][i]索勒伊马戏团[/i]的门票。我该去找找，看看能发现什么。",
  "Boye has found a love letter with an unexpected recipient; [i]a pissoir.[/i]": "博耶找到了一封情书，收信对象却出人意料——[i]一座小便池。[/i]",
  "I didn't want any part in it.": "我不想掺和这件事。",
  "Fencing the photo netted us a few crowns, but not enough. I'm going to have to look for something else...": "卖掉照片挣了几个克朗，但还不够。我得再找点别的……",
  "I've found a strange piece of equipment on the seafloor, seemingly from Räkan's exterior. Maybe someone on the crew might recognize it?": "我在海床发现了一件奇怪的设备，似乎原本装在虾号外壳上。船上也许有人认得它？",
  "The Stinger has been refitted to Räkan's hull. Approaching undetonated mines will... [i]\"deal with them\"[/i], if Polhem is to be believed.": "毒刺已重新装回虾号艇身。按波尔海姆的说法，靠近未爆水雷就能……[i]“处理掉它们”。[/i]",
